1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,400
你手里这杯咖啡，可能来自中国
The coffee in your hand may be from China

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,000
云南，种出了中国 98% 的咖啡
Yunnan grows 98% of China's coffee

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,600
一个普洱，就占了全国六成
Pu'er alone is 60% of the whole country

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:14,200
清晨采下红果，指尖还沾着雾
Dawn: red cherries picked, mist on the fingertips

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:17,800
晒床上翻晒，等一颗豆子醒来
On the drying beds, a bean slowly wakes

6
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:21,600
保山小粒——浓而不苦，微微果酸
Baoshan small-bean: bold, not bitter, faintly fruity

7
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:25,200
板扎！这就是山里给的答案
"Bǎnzā" — Yunnan for "superb." The mountain's answer

8
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:28,000
关注，带你去下一座城
Follow — I'll take you to the next city
